    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alien Shooters: Transform Your Home Into an Interdimensional Battlefield!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle waves of challenging invaders with high-tech laser weapons in this thrilling solo adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499170/extras/1151cf2f36271db3670757218e53a604.avif?t=1745586271\" data-has-big width=800 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Virutal Reality Magic</strong> \u2013 Portals open, blending real-world environments with virtual enemies and cosmic battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat</strong> \u2013 Use laser-equipped weapons to take down enemies, dodge laser beams, and survive escalating waves of attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Arsenal</strong> \u2013 Unlock and upgrade four unique weapons, including a revolver, tommy gun, grenade launcher, and shotgun, all enhanced with cutting-edge laser technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perks and Bonuses</strong> \u2013 Customize your gameplay with powerful perks and earn bonus points to climb the leaderboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Waves</strong> \u2013 Tackle 40+ levels of increasing difficulty, featuring flying enemies, asteroid strikes, and laser-shooting foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboard</strong> \u2013 Compete with players worldwide for the highest score in single-session gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Enemy Design</strong> \u2013 Each enemy is uniquely animated, adding to the thrill as they flutter, zoom, and attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499170/extras/a04348806e735264d7deaed77ffddd31.avif?t=1745586271\" data-has-big width=800 height=136 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
